  "boundaries": [
    "Witness service, CLI and result verifier are experimental; V0/V1 custody execution and source acceptance do not mandate these certificates.",
    "Historical result verification is distinct from current original-A source acceptance, proof freshness, Serve completion and rewards.",
    "Four logical witnesses ran on two observed kernels, using public deterministic fixture keys; independent four-domain or protected-key deployment is not established.",
    "The result commitment in the WAN witness-only case is deliberately opaque, not a custody proof.",
    "Quorum safety assumes fewer than one third of independent witness keys/locks are faulty; cloning enough witnesses invalidates that assumption.",
    "Physical consumption at the effect target, a new policy-bound custody assignment/proof version, split-vote progress, device campaigns, external review and public-testnet gates remain open.",
    "Native host tests ran as root and do not establish non-root permission or physical-device durability acceptance."
  ],
